{"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every type is a value. The generators ("},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Generators\/documentation\/Generators"},{"type":"text","text":") reproduce bit for bit on every platform"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and in every Swift release, and are "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Hashable"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sendable"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Codable"},{"type":"text","text":", so a position in a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sequence can be copied, compared, saved and restored. The draws ("},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Sampling\/documentation\/Sampling"},{"type":"text","text":") fix their"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"algorithms, where the standard library’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"random(in:using:)"},{"type":"text","text":" promises only a correct distribution."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A seed tree ("},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SeedTrees\/documentation\/SeedTrees"},{"type":"text","text":") gives each decision in a program a seed of its own, derived from a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"path of names and indices, so adding a draw anywhere never shifts the numbers elsewhere. A seed"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"search ("},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SeedDiscovery\/documentation\/SeedDiscovery"},{"type":"text","text":") finds the smallest seed in a range that does what a predicate asks,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sequentially or across cores, and a tree fits that seed into one subtree while the rest of the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"program stays as it was."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Bounds that cannot be sampled trap, like an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Array"},{"type":"text","text":" subscript; the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"checked"},{"type":"text","text":" spellings throw a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"typed error instead."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"import SwiftPRNG","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" imports every module. Each module also has its own documentation and can be","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"imported on its own.","type":"text"}]},{"code":["import SwiftPRNG","","let tree = SeedTree(42)","let fitted = tree.fitting([\"customer\", 7], in: SeedSearch(0 ..< 100_000)) { tree in","    tree[\"customer\", 7, \"arrival\"].uniform(in: 0 ..< 60) < 1","}","fitted?.overriddenSeeds  \/\/ [[\"customer\", 7]: 33]"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/SwiftPRNG\/documentation\/SwiftPRNG","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"metadata":{"title":"SwiftPRNG","modules":[{"name":"SwiftPRNG"}],"externalID":"SwiftPRNG","symbolKind":"module","roleHeading":"Framework","role":"collection"},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Generators\/documentation\/Generators","doc:\/\/Sampling\/documentation\/Sampling","doc:\/\/SeedDiscovery\/documentation\/SeedDiscovery","doc:\/\/SeedTrees\/documentation\/SeedTrees"],"title":"Modules","anchor":"Modules"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"abstract":[{"text":"Seeded random numbers whose seeds you can find, write down and hand to someone else.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/swiftprng"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"references":{"doc://Generators/documentation/Generators":{"title":"Generators","role":"collection","abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Generators\/documentation\/Generators","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/generators"},"doc://SwiftPRNG/documentation/SwiftPRNG":{"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftPRNG\/documentation\/SwiftPRNG","url":"\/documentation\/swiftprng","title":"SwiftPRNG","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Seeded random numbers whose seeds you can find, write down and hand to someone else."}],"type":"topic","role":"collection"},"doc://SeedTrees/documentation/SeedTrees":{"title":"SeedTrees","role":"collection","abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/SeedTrees\/documentation\/SeedTrees","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/seedtrees"},"doc://SeedDiscovery/documentation/SeedDiscovery":{"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/seeddiscovery","identifier":"doc:\/\/SeedDiscovery\/documentation\/SeedDiscovery","title":"SeedDiscovery","abstract":[],"type":"topic","role":"collection"},"doc://Sampling/documentation/Sampling":{"title":"Sampling","role":"collection","abstract":[],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Sampling\/documentation\/Sampling","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/sampling"}}}